# IdeasUI Theme Package: Improvement Roadmap

**Status:** Planning  
**Priority:** High Impact First  
**Timeline:** 4-6 weeks

---

## Phase 1: Documentation & Developer Experience (Week 1-2)

### 🎯 High Priority

- [ ] **Create Quick Start Guide**
  - Installation steps with `@source` directive
  - Basic usage examples
  - Common patterns
  - Troubleshooting section
  - **Effort:** 4h | **Impact:** Critical

- [ ] **Recipe API Documentation**
  - Document all recipe functions (`button`, etc.)
  - Show all variant combinations
  - Include TypeScript examples
  - Add Storybook integration guide
  - **Effort:** 6h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Migration Guide**
  - From Tailwind v3 → v4 setup
  - From CSS-in-JS libraries
  - From plain CSS approaches
  - Version upgrade guide
  - **Effort:** 4h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Add JSDoc Comments**
  - All recipe functions
  - All token exports
  - Plugin configuration options
  - **Effort:** 3h | **Impact:** Medium

### 🔧 Medium Priority

- [ ] **Create Starter Templates**
  - Next.js App Router template
  - Next.js Pages Router template
  - Vite + React template
  - Pre-configured with best practices
  - **Effort:** 8h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Interactive Recipe Playground**
  - Web UI to preview all variants
  - Copy-paste code snippets
  - Visual variant picker
  - **Effort:** 12h | **Impact:** Medium

---

## Phase 2: Expand Recipe Library (Week 2-3)

### 🎨 Core Components

- [ ] **Card Recipe**
  ```typescript
  // card.ts
  variants: { elevated, bordered, flat }
  slots: { base, header, body, footer }
  ```
  - **Effort:** 3h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Input Recipe**
  ```typescript
  // input.ts
  variants: { solid, outline, ghost }
  states: { error, success, disabled }
  ```
  - **Effort:** 4h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Badge Recipe**
  ```typescript
  // badge.ts
  variants: { solid, outline, soft }
  sizes: { sm, md, lg }
  ```
  - **Effort:** 2h | **Impact:** Medium

- [ ] **Avatar Recipe**
  ```typescript
  // avatar.ts
  sizes: { xs, sm, md, lg, xl }
  variants: { circular, rounded, square }
  ```
  - **Effort:** 2h | **Impact:** Medium

### 🔍 Advanced Components

- [ ] **Modal/Dialog Recipe**
  - Overlay, content, header, footer slots
  - Size variants
  - Animation variants
  - **Effort:** 5h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Dropdown/Select Recipe**
  - Trigger, content, item slots
  - Multi-select support
  - **Effort:** 6h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Tooltip Recipe**
  - Placement variants
  - Trigger variants
  - **Effort:** 2h | **Impact:** Low

