## Phase 5: Testing & Quality (Week 5-6)

### ✅ Testing Infrastructure

- [ ] **Recipe Unit Tests**
  ```typescript
  describe('button recipe', () => {
    it('generates correct classes for solid variant', () => {
      expect(button({ variant: 'solid' }).base()).toContain('btn--solid');
    });
  });
  ```
  - Test all recipes
  - Test all variant combinations
  - **Effort:** 8h | **Impact:** Critical

- [ ] **Visual Regression Tests**
  - Screenshot testing with Chromatic
  - All component variants
  - Light/dark modes
  - **Effort:** 10h | **Impact:** High

- [ ] **Accessibility Testing**
  ```typescript
  // Test color contrast
  // Test focus states
  // Test keyboard navigation
  ```
  - **Effort:** 6h | **Impact:** Critical

### 📊 Performance Testing

- [ ] **Bundle Size Benchmarks**
  - Track bundle size over time
  - Alert on size increases
  - **Effort:** 4h | **Impact:** Medium

- [ ] **Build Performance**
  - Measure Tailwind scan time
  - Optimize if needed
  - **Effort:** 3h | **Impact:** Low

